NOTE ON DATA LICENSING (not covered by the MIT License above):

The gold-standard CSV files (alexander_saga_persons.csv, alexander_saga_people.csv,
alexander_saga_locations.csv) and the diplomatic digital edition text derive from the
Medieval Nordic Text Archive (Menota) diplomatic edition "AM 519 a 4to : Alexanders saga"
by Andrea de Leeuw van Weenen, which is licensed under Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 (CC-BY-SA 4.0). Reuse of these data files must preserve that
attribution and share-alike requirement. The MIT License applies to the software only.
